  "steps": [
    "Cut three 18 in strips from the steel trim, deburring the cut ends with a file.",
    "Sand the strip faces with a medium grit and wipe them clean of oil.",
    "Glue the jars' lids to three magnetic discs so the jars screw on and stay put.",
    "Clean the fridge side with alcohol and stick the magnetic strips on, 6 in apart.",
    "Screw the jars on to the lids and load the spices, heaviest on the bottom row."
